  "system": {
    "identifier": "unglamorous-face",
    "description": "<p>A willing creature you touch, has its face twisted until it becomes as mundane as possible. So much so that they become absolutely un-unique and incapable of standing out.</p>\n<p>For the duration, they become unrecognizable and become unable to be pointed out in a crowd. You do not need to spend chakra to maintain concentration. A creature attempting to see through this illusion must make a Wisdom (Insight) or Wisdom (Illusions) check vs your Genjutsu Save DC. On a success, they become immune to this Genjutsu’s effects for the next hour.</p>",
